<title>AUSTRALIA: RIO TINTO NAMES HAMERSLEY IRON EXECUTIVES.</title>
<headline>RIO TINTO NAMES HAMERSLEY IRON EXECUTIVES.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Global mining giant Rio Tinto Plc/Ltd said on Wednesday its Hamersley Iron unit had appointed Sam Walsh as managing director operations and Ian Bauert as managing director sales and marketing.</p>
<p>The appointments are effective September 29.</p>
<p>Walsh is now managing director sales and marketing of Hamersley, and has been with the Rio Tinto group since 1991, the company said.</p>
<p>Bauert is managing director of Dampier Salt and has been with the Rio Tinto group for 18 years, it said.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373 1800</p>
</text>
